(Cloud)(On-prem) Cisco Talos and SMTP assets cannot be edited to update Access Control when granular permissions are enabled

Workaround:
https://<server>/rest/asset/<built_in_internal_asset_id> Example payload:
the key is the action name, roles contain the role ids and user contains the user ids.
{
 "action_whitelist": { "*": { "roles": [ "7", "3" ], "users": [ ] }, "roles": [ "8" ], "users": [], "get task from current phase": { "roles": [ "3", "8" ], "users": [] } } 
}
